      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "Thanks, this looks good to me now modulo some final nits.\r\n\r\n(It's a bit unfortunate JSON ended up with `application/json` rather than `text/json`. Most other web text formats use `text/`. And while I believe this might be the first place we directly expose it in the web platform, going with `text/json` would be rather brazen.)",
