      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "Yeah I know, it's just sad and mostly a consequence of some early ideas around `text/*` that ended up not mattering (at least not on the web).\r\n\r\nAnyway, thanks for all your hard work on this. This was not an easy feature given all the work on Web IDL, refactoring of various Fetch algorithms, etc. 😊\r\n\r\nI suggest we give folks until May 18 to voice any remaining concerns and merge it that day sometime.",
